# The engraving library (`reference/`) — third-party publications, held as LOCAL research copies
# only. The MANIFEST is tracked and the bytes are not: `reference/README.md` records what each
# source answered and how to fetch it again, which is the part that keeps costing agent-hours to
# rediscover (the archive.org copy of Behind Bars went dark mid-investigation on 2026-08-17).
reference/*
!reference/README.md
